WasmLogic contains material ported from Iris-Wasm
(https://github.com/logsem/iriswasm, commit
e37f8387a1171d104d78a2f77f9e637e090cf3d4): the stack module and its client
from theories/iris/examples/stack/ (WasmLogic/Examples/Stack/stack.wat,
WasmLogic/Examples/Client/client.wat and the fragments of their Code.lean),
the statements of their specifications and the loop invariant of stack_map
(Stack/Specs.lean, Stack/Map.lean, Client/Main.lean), and the names of the
instruction rules (Coverage.lean). The proofs are written anew in Lean. Its
